Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:29.211 --> 00:02:31.477
Did you hear about the match-fixing scandal?

46
00:02:32.783 --> 00:02:36.469
Yes. Never before had the league faced such a serious problem.

47
00:02:37.783 --> 00:02:40.839
And a famous runner was banned for doping last month.

48
00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:46.683
Rarely do we see so many scandals in one year. Fair play rules must be stricter.

49
00:02:47.983 --> 00:02:51.527
